From 676597c1f6f03820290ff974a5d289b7841cf925 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 03:31:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(blocks): add MusicBrainz block for search, lookup,
 browse and release submission (#184)

Adds a `musicbrainz` Flow block backed by a shared MusicBrainzService for
the MusicBrainz WS/2 API:

- search, lookup (MBID + inc=) and browse (linked entities) for all
  MusicBrainz entity types, with request validation and readable errors
- one app-wide request queue at most one request per second, retry with
  back-off on 503/429, de-duplication and a short response cache
- User-Agent "KendraioApp/<version> ( contact url )" as MusicBrainz asks;
  only headers allowed by MusicBrainz CORS are sent (no ngsw-bypass)
- seed-release operation: prepares MusicBrainz release editor seeding
  fields and opens the editor so artists can submit a release
- demo Flows under /musicbrainz (dashboard, search artists / releases /
  recordings, artist, release group, release, recording, submit release),
  also packaged as an installable `musicbrainz` adapter in the built-in
  adapter repository
- block documentation and focused unit tests

Refs #184
