+ * MusicBrainz release editor ("release editor seeding").
+ *
+ * See https://wiki.musicbrainz.org/Development/Release_Editor_Seeding
+ *
+ * Accepted shape (all keys optional except name and at least one track per medium):
+ * {
+ *   name, releaseGroup, type: 'album' | ['album', 'live'], comment, annotation, barcode,
+ *   language, script, status, packaging,
+ *   artistCredit: 'Artist name' | [{ mbid, name, artistName, joinPhrase }],
+ *   events: [{ date: 'YYYY-MM-DD' | { year, month, day }, country }],
+ *   labels: [{ mbid, name, catalogNumber }],
+ *   mediums: [{ format, name, tracks: [{ name, number, recording, length, artistCredit }] }],
+ *   urls: [{ url, linkType }] | ['https://...'],
+ *   editNote, redirectUri
